Type: 1-handed
Requires: 5 Strength~

@7057 = ~Treefolk's Fury +5

This thunderous weapon of nature glows with a supernatural aura, inspiring both awe and fear in those who dare to cross the wielder's path.

STATISTICS:

Equipped ability:
+2 bonus to Strength
+50% Resistance to Cold

THAC0: +5, +7 vs. unnatural creatures
Damage: 1D6 +8, +10 vs. unnatural creatures
5% chance to inflict 20 points of acid damage on hit
5% chance to inflict 20 points of poison damage on hit
5% chance to inflict 20 points of fire damage on hit
