@7061 = ~With the addition of the fifth and final head to this weapon created by the evil Rakshasa race the true potential of the Flail of Ages is finally realized.

STATISTICS:

Equipped Ability:
- 10% bonus to Magic Resistance
- 10% bonus to all elementatl resistances

Combat Abilities:
- 15% chance per hit to inflict 15 points of additional crushing damage
- 5% chance per hit to inflict 10 Fire Damage, 10 Cold Damage, 10 Acid Damage, 10 Poison Damage and 10 Electrical Damage

THACO: +5 bonus
Damage: 1D6 +6
Damage type: crushing
Weight: 8
