@7120 = ~Lakesider's Dream +5

Despite its simple structure and lack of any particular adornments, this axe looks very beautiful. The axe's blade reflects the slow and calm waves of the surface of an unknown lake. The original relic had been given to you by swanmays as a sign of their gratitude for your precious help to their community. Adorned with the exquisite water opal gem and imbued with the enchanted water taken from the magic pond in Lord Wetlander's residence, the axe has now reached its full potential.

