@7121 = ~Phosphorus +5

'Phosphorus' is an alternate name for Morning star. The morning star is a wooden shaft topped with a metal head made up of a spiked iron sheath. Morning stars have an overall length of about four feet. Strong enchantments, however, have made this particular morning star lighter, faster, and far more deadly than a normal weapon of this kind. Due to other ingredients used in its fabrication, the mighty weapon also grants the strength of a Storm Giant to its wielder.

The flail was further improved by the artificer Lady Elowen.

